Package: RiOMar
Title: River plume analysis along the French coast
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Not an installable R package. This file lists the R packages the
    RiOMar pipeline (func/*.R, and R code called from Python via rpy2) depends
    on, so that renv can snapshot them. On the reference machine, run once:
        renv::init(settings = list(snapshot.type = "explicit"))
    which records exact versions in renv.lock; later, renv::snapshot() after
    installing/updating packages. On a new machine: renv::restore().
